       Controlled decodability. For image 𝑖, let h𝑖𝑡 ∈ R𝐷 denote the 𝐷-dimensional representation of
1272   visual token 𝑡 at the consumed final block; mean pooling over tokens yields h𝑖 . A fixed seed-0
1273   Gaussian matrix 𝑅 ∈ R𝐷×512 projects every model to a common readout dimension; featurewise
1274   scale 𝒔 is fitted on training rows only. We then fit logistic regression with 𝐶 = 1, maximum 2,000
1275   iterations, and seed 0. Each of 20 control seeds maps the recurring input type (AP view indicator, sex
1276   indicator, and age decade, giving 39 strata) to a random label. Let 𝑦 be the real test labels and 𝑟 the
1277   fitted probe’s continuous scores. For control seed 𝑘 ∈ {0, . . . , 19}, 𝑦 ctrl
                                                                                 𝑘 denotes the random labels
