1777
       The standardized deviations are centered on the observed 𝐶             ˆ︁𝑗 , not on 𝐶 ∗𝑗 . For a component with
1778
1779   𝑠 𝑗 ≤ 10−12 , all its 𝑍 𝑏 𝑗 values are set to zero. If every component satisfies that threshold, the
1780   critical value is zero. Otherwise, each draw’s maximum includes these zero components, and its
1781   empirical 95th percentile uses linear interpolation. All 5,000 draws are retained. The final subtraction
       𝐿𝑗 = 𝐶 ˆ︁𝑗 − 𝑐 .95 𝑠 𝑗 still uses the actual 𝑠 𝑗 , including for thresholded components.


